			<item>
				<title>Should You Shut Down Your Laptop? The Electricity Behind Sleep Mode</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/laptop-sleep-mode/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/laptop-sleep-mode/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;should-you-shut-down-your-laptop&#34;&gt;Should You Shut Down Your Laptop?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;before-we-look-at-the-data&#34;&gt;Before we look at the data&amp;hellip;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;poll laptop-poll&#34; data-poll-id=&#34;laptop-sleep&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;poll-question&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        How many hours of 10 W LED lighting could the extra electricity from leaving a laptop in Sleep mode represent over one year?&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;poll-description&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        For comparison, a 10 W LED bulb can provide general lighting for a room.&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;poll-options&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;10-or-less&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        💡 10 hours or less&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;11-50&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            💡💡 11–50 hours&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;51-120&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            💡💡💡 51–120 hours&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;more-than-121&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            💡💡💡💡 More than 121 hours&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;poll-privacy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        Your vote is completely anonymous. No personal data is collected.&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Dishwasher vs Hand Washing</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/dishwasher-vs-handwashing/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/dishwasher-vs-handwashing/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;dishwasher-vs-hand-washing&#34;&gt;Dishwasher vs Hand Washing&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;before-we-look-at-the-data&#34;&gt;Before we look at the data&amp;hellip;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;poll&#34; data-poll-id=&#34;dishwasher-water&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;h3 class=&#34;poll-question&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        Before reading the numbers: which do you think uses less water?&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;poll-options&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;dishwasher&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            🍽️ Dishwasher&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;poll-option&#34; data-option=&#34;hand-washing&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;            🧼 Hand washing&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;poll-privacy&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        Your vote is completely anonymous. No personal data is collected.&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;poll-result&#34; hidden&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;strong&gt;Your vote is in!&lt;/strong&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;poll-percentages&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;poll-votes-count&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now let&#39;s see what the data says.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;script&gt;&#xD;&#xA;document.addEventListener(&#34;DOMContentLoaded&#34;, function () {&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    const poll = document.querySelector(&#34;.poll&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;    if (!poll) return;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    const pollId = poll.dataset.pollId;&#xD;&#xA;    const buttons = poll.querySelectorAll(&#34;.poll-option&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    const result = poll.querySelector(&#34;.poll-result&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;    const percentages = poll.querySelector(&#34;.poll-percentages&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;    const votesCount = poll.querySelector(&#34;.poll-votes-count&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    const SUPABASE_URL = &#34;https://qaxnrgswltuzjkayskkh.supabase.co&#34;;&#xD;&#xA;    const SUPABASE_KEY = &#34;sb_publishable_Agh45qyVe7NGG7MnA8bL3Q_QDNPz83U&#34;;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    async function loadResults() {&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        const response = await fetch(&#xD;&#xA;            SUPABASE_URL +&#xD;&#xA;            &#34;/rest/v1/poll_votes?select=option&amp;poll_id=eq.&#34; +&#xD;&#xA;            encodeURIComponent(pollId),&#xD;&#xA;            {&#xD;&#xA;                method: &#34;GET&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;                headers: {&#xD;&#xA;                    &#34;apikey&#34;: SUPABASE_KEY,&#xD;&#xA;                    &#34;Authorization&#34;: &#34;Bearer &#34; + SUPABASE_KEY&#xD;&#xA;                }&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;        );&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        if (!response.ok) {&#xD;&#xA;            const errorText = await response.text();&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            console.error(&#xD;&#xA;                &#34;Supabase results error:&#34;,&#xD;&#xA;                response.status,&#xD;&#xA;                errorText&#xD;&#xA;            );&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            throw new Error(&#34;Results could not be loaded.&#34;);&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        const votes = await response.json();&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        console.log(&#34;Poll ID:&#34;, pollId);&#xD;&#xA;console.log(&#34;Votes from Supabase:&#34;, votes);&#xD;&#xA;        &#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        let dishwasherVotes = 0;&#xD;&#xA;        let handWashingVotes = 0;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        votes.forEach(function (vote) {&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            if (vote.option === &#34;dishwasher&#34;) {&#xD;&#xA;                dishwasherVotes++;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            if (vote.option === &#34;hand-washing&#34;) {&#xD;&#xA;                handWashingVotes++;&#xD;&#xA;            }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        });&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        const totalVotes = dishwasherVotes + handWashingVotes;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        let dishwasherPercent = 0;&#xD;&#xA;        let handWashingPercent = 0;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        if (totalVotes &gt; 0) {&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            dishwasherPercent = Math.round(&#xD;&#xA;                (dishwasherVotes / totalVotes) * 100&#xD;&#xA;            );&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;            handWashingPercent = Math.round(&#xD;&#xA;                (handWashingVotes / totalVotes) * 100&#xD;&#xA;            );&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        }&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        percentages.innerHTML = `&#xD;&#xA;            &lt;p&gt;🍽️ Dishwasher: &lt;strong&gt;${dishwasherPercent}%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Turning the Tap Off While Brushing Teeth</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/toothbrushing-water/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/everyday-data/research/toothbrushing-water/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;how-much-water-can-one-person-save-while-brushing-teeth&#34;&gt;How Much Water Can One Person Save While Brushing Teeth?&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;images/toothbrush-cleaning.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Toothbrush and water&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Photo: ulleo / Pixabay&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We brush our teeth every day. But have you ever wondered how much water flows down the drain while we do it?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It is a small everyday habit, but it gives us a nice opportunity to look at something familiar through data.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;So, does it actually make a difference? Let&amp;rsquo;s simply see what the numbers say.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
